  str_n38_hard_intro_body_1 = "1. Shipwrecked mode contains 3 waypoints, and each waypoint consists of 2–3 stages. There is no sequential connection between these stages, and you can challenge any waypoint stage you want.\n2.Each waypoint has 3–5 Challenge Trophies. Use the required lineups to clear the stages according to the Trophy conditions, and you'll earn the Trophies and their corresponding rewards.\n3.When challenging stages in the same waypoint, you are required to use different Aurorians.",
