  str_n38_13_levelname = "ST3 - Homecoming",
  str_n38_1_levelname_desc = "—",
  str_n38_2_levelname_desc = "The Shadowind's repairs are nearly complete, but you suddenly fall victim to an unexpected attack. Standing between you and certain doom, however, is...",
  str_n38_3_levelname_desc = "With the banquet aboard the Shadowind well underway, Dantang begins to worry about your absence. She is completely oblivious to the danger lurking within the bowels of the ship...",
  str_n38_4_levelname_desc = "With Xuan Ji's help, you continue searching for the origins of the rogue Clockwork Beasts. Aside from the warehouse, it seems every pharmacy in the port town is also highly suspicious.",
  str_n38_5_levelname_desc = "Everyone has their own reasons for returning to Longzhou as soon as possible, so who could be the real target of this sinister plot?",
  str_n38_6_levelname_desc = "—",
  str_n38_7_levelname_desc = "Even in the vast open sea, there is no escaping the hordes of Eclipsites, which are referred to as \"wicked spirits\" in Longzhou.",
  str_n38_8_levelname_desc = "On a howling, stormy night, a flash of lightning strikes the Shadowind and sets off a massive explosion. Through the chaos, you sense the presence of a special power...",
  str_n38_9_levelname_desc = "The next morning, peace is finally restored to the ship, but the waters become entirely unfamiliar. It appears the ship veered off course during last night's ordeal.",
  str_n38_10_levelname_desc = "Disoriented, the Shadowind arrives in a place where countless ships lie sunken in the waters. To escape their treacherous situation, Xuan Ji sacrifices her sect's prized possession; however, a new danger is looming just beyond their sight...",
  str_n38_11_levelname_desc = "The sudden attack from both pirates and Clockwork Beasts catches you off-guard, but Xuan Ji quickly devises a new strategy. She believes that even you can contribute greatly in the upcoming battle.",
  str_n38_12_levelname_desc = "As the fight rages on, it appears Xuan Ji has discovered the identity of the pirate captain. That person is none other than...",
  str_n38_13_levelname_desc = "—",
  str_n38_1_name_desc_long = "After accepting a job from the Lin Guild, you arrive in Twin Pavilions Bay for the very first time and watch as the Shadowind, one of their enormous merchant ships, arrives in port. Mu Yuebai, captain of the ship, announces that it will be docked for the next two weeks for some desperately needed repairs. To that end, Dantang recommends a certain artisan in Twin Pavilions Bay for the job.",
  str_n38_2_name_desc_long = "After spending two productive weeks in Twin Pavilions Bay, the Shadowind's repairs are finally complete, and Dantang succeeds in convincing an envoy from Lumopolis to attend the celebratory banquet. However, before you can join them, you are attacked by a group of vicious Clockwork Beasts that suddenly appear in the city. At the very last second, Xuan Ji appears and saves you from danger—She is the artisan that Dantang mentioned earlier, as well as the original designer of these clockwork beasts.",
  str_n38_3_name_desc_long = "During the banquet, the Shadowind's cabin is invaded by a number of Clockwork Beasts. The Lin Guild wishes to delay the ship's departure following the attack, but Dantang worries that her mission will end in failure if she doesn't return to the Ji Kingdom soon enough. After all of her efforts to persuade Lumopolis to send an envoy, delaying the journey would only result in unimaginable losses.",
  str_n38_4_name_desc_long = "You and Xuan Ji continue searching for the origins of the Clockwork Beasts. While investigating a certain pharmacy, you come to blows with an unknown fighter. After realizing that both sides are mistaken, you discover that your opponents are Zhong Xu, an ex-official of Longzhou, and Liqing, a Lin Family ship doctor. Upon returning to the Shadowind, Dantang urges you to replace the Lumopolis envoy as Astra's newest emissary to the east.",
  str_n38_5_name_desc_long = "You agree to travel to Longzhou as a representative of Astra, hoping that the two continents will be able to secure a better future for themselves. Zhong Xu also reveals his reasons for wanting to quickly return to Longzhou, as well as his reasons for being attacked. Under the pressure from so many different people, the Lin Family has no choice but to let the Shadowind depart as soon as possible. Meanwhile, Xuan Ji begins her own preparations for the long journey ahead.",
  str_n38_6_name_desc_long = "The day of departure finally arrives, and everyone has made ample preparations for the voyage. Loaded with plenty of food and medicine, the ship and its crew are ready to set sail. Before leaving, you also send farewell letters to Vice and Carleen explaining the situation.",
  str_n38_7_name_desc_long = "Out in the open sea, Xuan Ji volunteers to serve as the Shadowind's source of navigation as the Lin Family's armillary sphere has been lost. During your conversations with her and Dantang, you learn much about Longzhou, navigation in general, and some of the problems they face in the Ye Kingdom. Zhong Xu mentions things about Fiendlings and Eclipsites in Longzhou, and it provides you with a few new perspectives.",
  str_n38_8_name_desc_long = "During a stormy night, a flash of lightning rips through the sky, striking the Shadowind and setting off an explosion deep inside the ship. As everyone works together to put out the flames and repair the damage, you discover what appears to be the source of the fire. Before long, however, you are all but engulfed in a sea of flames.",
  str_n38_9_name_desc_long = "By the second day, the weather had cleared, and the fires had all been extinguished. Under Liqing's medical treatment, you soon regain consciousness and recall the feeling of being swallowed up by last night's fire. Xuan Ji reports that last night's incident caused the ship to veer off course, and soon, they are ambushed by a group of mysterious sea creatures. The Shadowind and its crew narrowly escape and begin salvaging what they can in the aftermath of the attack.",
  str_n38_10_name_desc_long = "The Shadowind arrives in a treacherous part of the ocean, where the wreckage of countless ships adorns the sea floor. As a last-ditch attempt to rescue the ship and its passengers, Xuan Ji decides to use the Zhuyin Flame, one of her sect's most treasured objects. It's the power you sensed last night, and it was caused by someone secretly removing its seal. Suddenly, a ship appears in the distance, apparently in response to the Shadowind's distress signal. As it draws nearer, however, you realize that the approaching vessel is actually a pirate ship!",
  str_n38_11_name_desc_long = "A horde of pirates begins attacking the crew with enormous Clockwork Beasts, so you and Xuan Ji decide to split up and strike from different angles. While she fends off the attacking pirates, you free Zhong Xu and Liqing from the mechanical cage that imprisoned them. As Zhong Xu plunges into the heart of battle, his unstoppable strength reminds everyone of his past as the Grand General of the Zhao Empire.",
  str_n38_12_name_desc_long = "While scanning for the weak points in their Clockwork Beasts, Xuan Ji makes a startling discovery: the leader of the pirates is none other than Zhui Hu, a woman who was once her senior in their studies. The inventor of these powerful machines, she has since fallen to smuggling and piracy in order to survive. After a long and bitter battle, the Shadowind's crew finally manages to repel the pirates and their mechanized monsters.",
  str_n38_13_name_desc_long = "The Shadowind finally makes landfall in Longzhou. Dantang completes her mission, Zhong Xu and Liqing finally reunite with the Lin Guildmaster, and Xuan Ji plans to begin a new mission. Though the dust appears to have finally settled, a figure in the shadows secretly prepares for the coming storm...",
  str_n38_hard_name_1 = "H1 - Ship Oar",
  str_n38_hard_name_2 = "H2 - Sail Shadows",
  str_n38_hard_name_3 = "H3 - Mast and Scull",
  str_n38_hard_name_4 = "H4 - Flipped Oars",
  str_n38_hard_desc_1 = "Unmarked reefs are hidden in the waters ahead. Slow down to identify your route carefully.",
  str_n38_hard_desc_2 = "A gale starts blowing on the sea. Tighten the sail ropes quickly to stabilize the ship.",
  str_n38_hard_desc_3 = "A huge wave is crashing towards you. Secure all facilities on the deck quickly.",
  str_n38_hard_desc_4 = "A steep cliff has suddenly appeared on the seabed. Turn around immediately so you don't crash into it and damage your ship.",
